669
01:05:43,894 --> 01:05:48,494
アリーナ！アリーナの前に例えばフォーラムとかさ、ねえ！
The Arena! Before the Arena, like, the Forum, you know!

670
01:06:07,434 --> 01:06:13,224
奇跡のような 君と作るめまい
A miraculous dizziness created with you,

671
01:06:17,424 --> 01:06:22,024
ぎゅっと握りしめた手がだよ
the hand I held so tightly—

672
01:06:22,424 --> 01:06:29,024
きっと体感する わくわくの始まりの
I'm sure we'll feel the start of that excitement

673
01:06:29,324 --> 01:06:35,224
この場所が初めての
in this brand new place.

674
01:06:35,724 --> 01:06:45,124
違う道進んでも ちょっとずつでも踏み入れてみて
Even if we take different paths, take a step in little by little;

675
01:06:45,424 --> 01:06:54,024
幸せはすぐそばにあるから 怖がらないで
happiness is right by your side, so don't be afraid—

676
01:06:54,024 --> 01:07:01,624
夢中になるその力がもっと未来を呼ぶよ
the power of losing yourself in it will call out even more!

677
01:07:04,344 --> 01:07:11,044
この空に放たれた 叫び聞かせるよ
I'll let you hear the cry released into this sky!

678
01:07:11,344 --> 01:07:17,144
何よりも強い命の息吹
Stronger than anything else, the breath of life

679
01:07:17,344 --> 01:07:26,244
満面の未来の物語になるから
will become a story of a smiling future,

680
01:07:26,244 --> 01:07:33,744
隣でぬぐってあげる 小さな涙
wiping away your little tears right by your side.

681
01:07:33,744 --> 01:07:41,144
小さな幸せあつもる 未来へ
Toward a future where small happiness gathers,

682
01:07:42,144 --> 01:07:48,944
なんだかじっとする 安らぎは
somehow, that comforting peace

683
01:07:49,244 --> 01:07:54,944
足跡が語る 形の結晶で
is the crystallized shape told by our footprints.

684
01:07:55,244 --> 01:08:04,944
次は君がいるから 希望あふれるまで
Next time, since you're here, until hope overflows,

685
01:08:05,144 --> 01:08:12,444
ちょっとずつでも踏み入れてみて
try stepping in, even just a little bit at a time.

686
01:08:12,444 --> 01:08:19,444
幸せはすぐそばにあるから 怖がらないで
Happiness is right by your side, so don't be afraid—

687
01:08:19,744 --> 01:08:25,944
抱えていこう With you...
let's hold onto it. With you...

688
01:08:25,944 --> 01:08:33,944
散らばった 時の欠片たちを
Scattered pieces of time,

689
01:08:34,144 --> 01:08:40,444
拾い集めれば ほら新しい世界
if we gather them up, look, a brand new world

690
01:08:40,944 --> 01:08:50,944
開くはずだから 夢中で歌うよ
is bound to open up, so I'll sing with all my heart.

691
01:08:55,444 --> 01:09:01,444
今日も明日もありがとう 歌っていくよ
Thank you for today and tomorrow too, I'll keep singing,

692
01:09:01,744 --> 01:09:09,944
鮮やかな花を咲かすために
to make vibrant flowers bloom!

693
01:09:10,444 --> 01:09:17,444
この空へ何回にして見せるよ
I'll show you how many times I can reach up to this sky!

694
01:09:17,744 --> 01:09:23,444
何よりも強い命の息吹
Stronger than anything else, the breath of life

695
01:09:23,744 --> 01:09:32,444
満面の未来の物語になるから
will become a story of a smiling future,

696
01:09:32,444 --> 01:09:39,944
隣でぬぐってあげる 小さな幸せあつもる
wiping away your little tears, gathering small happiness,

697
01:09:40,144 --> 01:09:50,944
未来へ 奇跡のような 君と作るめまい
toward the future... A miraculous dizziness created with you.

698
01:10:25,555 --> 01:10:28,075
はじける青は オンリーワン
The sparkling blue is one and only,

699
01:10:28,195 --> 01:10:31,675
輝いてよ 今という瞬間を
Shine bright in this very moment!

700
01:10:32,015 --> 01:10:35,635
悔しくて溢れ出す涙の向こうに
Beyond the tears of frustration overflowing,

701
01:10:35,755 --> 01:10:38,895
君だけの新しい景色が広がる
A brand new scenery meant just for you unfolds.

702
01:10:39,075 --> 01:10:42,775
夢中で走り続けた 笑い合い喧嘩もした
Running on in a dream, laughing and even fighting,

703
01:10:42,955 --> 01:10:46,015
1秒で変わる世界 可能性を信じて
A world changing in a second, believing in possibilities,

704
01:10:46,155 --> 01:10:49,655
高まる期待値を 飛び跳ねるワンストローク
Rising expectations, jumping with a single stroke—

705
01:10:49,775 --> 01:10:52,095
君が主役の物語だ
This is a story where you are the protagonist!

706
01:10:54,315 --> 01:10:56,655
はじける日々は オンリーワン
The sparkling days are one and only,

707
01:10:56,815 --> 01:11:00,635
輝いてよ 青のシャワーを浴びて
Shine bright, bathing in the blue shower!

708
01:11:02,375 --> 01:11:04,215
全力で僕ら叫んでいる
We are shouting with all our might.

709
01:11:04,375 --> 01:11:07,735
大人になっていく 今この瞬間を
Growing up into adults, in this very moment—

710
01:11:07,735 --> 01:11:10,895
キラめいて
Keep sparkling!

711
01:11:11,115 --> 01:11:15,555
掴んだ一片のピースを 育てて永遠の My precious
Nurture the single piece you grabbed into eternal "My precious."

712
01:11:15,835 --> 01:11:19,695
これまでの道のりを 明日へと繋げよう
Let's connect the path we've walked so far toward tomorrow.

713
01:11:19,835 --> 01:11:24,875
流れていく時は 二度と戻らないって分かっているんだ
Knowing that time flowing by will never return.

714
01:11:29,235 --> 01:11:31,735
無限の夏の空へ
To the infinite summer sky—

715
01:11:45,975 --> 01:11:48,755
無くした鍵は見つかった
The lost key was found,

716
01:11:48,915 --> 01:11:52,315
燃えるゴミの日に出しちゃった
But I accidentally threw it out on burnable trash day!

717
01:11:52,405 --> 01:11:55,065
身動きまったくできなくて
I couldn't move at all...

718
01:11:56,225 --> 01:11:59,965
君のスペシャルな夢の続き
The continuation of your special dream...

719
01:12:01,395 --> 01:12:04,135
子供みたいに会うく願いならいいのに
If only it were a wish to meet like children,

720
01:12:06,975 --> 01:12:10,075
近づけば 降りの中さ
Approaching, it's inside the rain.

721
01:12:23,895 --> 01:12:26,795
胸の隅で生きてんだ
It lives quietly in the corner of my heart,

722
01:12:27,095 --> 01:12:30,095
泣くのは きっと大事なものだから
Because crying is surely something precious.

723
01:12:32,595 --> 01:12:38,855
間違っても さすよっても 離しないでよ
Even if we make mistakes, even if we wander, don't let go!

724
01:12:39,655 --> 01:12:44,295
空の果て 感情の その先を見つめて
At the edge of the sky, gazing beyond our emotions—

725
01:12:44,555 --> 01:12:47,655
飛びたいの この色 じがけて
I want to fly, coloring this color...

726
01:12:55,655 --> 01:12:58,775
もう何もいらないから 忘れさせないから
Because I need nothing else, because I won't let you forget,

727
01:13:01,055 --> 01:13:04,755
どこまでも 遠くへと
To the far distance, wherever it may be!

728
01:13:05,055 --> 01:13:07,855
ありのまま つむいで
Spun just as it is,

729
01:13:08,055 --> 01:13:11,655
手の風に 涙を拭うように
Like wiping away tears in the breeze of our hands,

730
01:13:11,955 --> 01:13:17,255
危なみを越えて 秘密のつばさで
Crossing over dangers, on secret wings—

731
01:13:17,855 --> 01:13:21,255
行こう 無限の夏の空へ
Let's go to the infinite summer sky!

732
01:13:58,955 --> 01:14:04,325
みんな、どうでしたか？しっとり歌っちゃったよ。
How was it, everyone? I sang a soulful ballad.

733
01:14:09,235 --> 01:14:13,515
みんなからのメッセージの映像も見れた？
Did you all get to see the video messages from everyone?

734
01:14:17,315 --> 01:14:21,755
ちょっとだけ昼と文言変わっての気付いた？
Did you notice the wording changed slightly from the daytime show?

735
01:14:24,635 --> 01:14:33,375
みんなと一緒にこれからも歩いていきたい、そんな気持ちを込めてメッセージ書きました。伝わったかな？
I wrote that message hoping to keep walking forward together.

736
01:14:37,635 --> 01:14:41,155
そして、ドレスの衣装だよ。
And look, this is my dress outfit!

737
01:14:42,315 --> 01:14:49,175
ありがとう！やっぱりね、あの、この曲を歌うんならドレスかなと思って、この前もさ、これで踊ったじゃん。
I thought a dress would fit best for singing this song.

738
01:14:52,495 --> 01:15:00,315
その時のエピソードが、「え、もう1回」っていうのをすごいいっぱい聞いたから、今回もエモエモの涙でみんなを「おー！」って...
I heard so many people say "One more time!" about that moment.

739
01:15:01,352 --> 01:15:03,112
させようと思って歌っちゃった
I thought I'd make you do it, but I ended up singing it!

740
01:15:04,092 --> 01:15:05,552
エモくなった？
Did it get emotional?

741
01:15:07,032 --> 01:15:08,932
なんか自分でエモいっていうのやだね、なんか恥ずかしいわ
Saying "emotional" about myself feels weird... kind of embarrassing.

742
01:15:12,832 --> 01:15:17,572
そんな感じでね、なんと中盤戦もここまでなんですよね
And with that, surprisingly, we've already reached the middle part of the concert.

743
01:15:21,172 --> 01:15:22,292
早いね
It's fast, isn't it?

744
01:15:28,452 --> 01:15:30,992
まだ見たい？ まだ見たいの？
Do you want to see more? Do you want to see more?

745
01:15:32,772 --> 01:15:34,712
