752
01:16:05,232 --> 01:16:08,232
というわけでここからはさ、盛り上げる曲聴きたくない？
So from here on, don't you want to hear some hype songs?

753
01:16:15,372 --> 01:16:17,612
というわけでラスト盛り上がっていくよー！
So let's get hyped for the final stretch!

754
01:16:50,237 --> 01:16:54,097
あの日の空線のどこかで繋がって
Connected somewhere in the sky's horizon of that day,

755
01:16:54,097 --> 01:16:57,797
あなたとダンスを踊ろうか
Shall we dance together?

756
01:16:57,797 --> 01:17:02,107
分かったような顔の奥で出逢って
Meeting deep within familiar-looking faces,

757
01:17:02,107 --> 01:17:04,477
体中で煌めいて
Sparkling throughout our bodies!

758
01:17:05,382 --> 01:17:06,882
みんなの声が
Everyone's voices—

759
01:17:06,882 --> 01:17:10,482
もっと！もっと！
More! More!

760
01:17:10,982 --> 01:17:13,482
行くよー！
Here we go!

761
01:17:17,102 --> 01:17:19,992
すれ違う度 二人 空で並んでる
Passing each other by, the two of us line up in the sky,

762
01:17:19,992 --> 01:17:24,132
胸弾ませて 眠れない夜 寂しくなって
Hearts fluttering, unable to sleep through the lonely night,

763
01:17:24,132 --> 01:17:27,522
交わる どんな糸でも 誤魔化し切れない
No matter what intersecting threads, we can't hide it,

764
01:17:27,522 --> 01:17:29,822
変わることはないわ
It will never change.

765
01:17:29,822 --> 01:17:33,302
星屑の歩道で あなた見つけて奇跡さ
Finding you on the stardust sidewalk—what a miracle!

766
01:17:33,302 --> 01:17:36,022
今は 離れない
Now, we won't part.

767
01:17:36,022 --> 01:17:40,082
こんなに激しく 見える目をも愛しく
Looking at eyes so fierce with affection,

768
01:17:40,082 --> 01:17:42,322
今は 距離がないわ
Now, there's no distance between us.

769
01:17:42,322 --> 01:17:47,382
足がもつれて 胸が高鳴って 気付けば身体から
Feet tangling, heart beating fast, before I knew it, from my body—

770
01:17:47,862 --> 01:17:51,542
あの日の空線のどこかで繋がって
Connected somewhere in the sky's horizon of that day,

771
01:17:51,542 --> 01:17:55,382
あなたとダンスを踊ろうか
Shall we dance together?

772
01:17:55,382 --> 01:17:59,522
分かったような顔の奥で出逢って
Meeting deep within familiar-looking faces,

773
01:17:59,522 --> 01:18:01,802
体中で煌めいて
Sparkling throughout our bodies!

774
01:18:01,802 --> 01:18:05,682
手を繋いで
Holding hands,

775
01:18:06,082 --> 01:18:09,502
あなたに届け
Reaching out to you.

776
01:18:09,502 --> 01:18:13,142
宇宙の果てから
From the edge of the universe,

777
01:18:13,142 --> 01:18:16,522
新しい景色へ
Toward a brand new scenery!

778
01:18:25,262 --> 01:18:26,282
行くぞ！
Let's go!

779
01:18:26,282 --> 01:18:30,782
世界中のダンスは 星屑から始まるのさ
Dances all over the world begin from stardust!

780
01:18:30,782 --> 01:18:33,522
見体験のステージで は！は！は！は！
On an unprecedented stage, ha! ha! ha! ha!

781
01:18:33,522 --> 01:18:37,702
雷鳴のダンスで 周回軌道上のドラムさ
With thunderous dancing, drums on the orbit!

782
01:18:37,702 --> 01:18:40,102
太陽系のメロディ は！は！は！は！
The solar system's melody, ha! ha! ha! ha!

783
01:18:40,102 --> 01:18:46,302
巡り合って 見つかった二人忘れることはない
Having met, the two of us will never forget.

784
01:18:46,302 --> 01:18:50,002
今は 求めたい
Now, I want to seek more.

785
01:18:50,002 --> 01:18:53,322
閉じせいを救う 触れた世界も不思議と
Even the touched world saving closed existence is mysteriously—

786
01:18:53,322 --> 01:18:56,742
今は どれもいいわ
Right now, any of it is fine.

787
01:18:56,742 --> 01:19:00,302
なんとなくだって なんとなくだって 星は巡っていく
Somehow, just somehow, the stars keep revolving.

788
01:19:00,302 --> 01:19:04,522
あの日の空線のどこかで輝いて
Shining somewhere in the sky's horizon of that day,

789
01:19:04,522 --> 01:19:08,402
はるかな彼方で煌めいて
Sparkling in the distant beyond!

790
01:19:08,402 --> 01:19:12,802
分かったような顔の奥で 取り返して さあ！
Recover it deep within familiar-looking faces, come on!

791
01:19:13,142 --> 01:19:17,102
手を繋いで あなたのすべてを求めようか
Holding hands, shall we seek everything about you?

792
01:19:17,102 --> 01:19:23,182
誰も知らない この場所だけの旅路で
On a journey in this place no one knows,

793
01:19:23,182 --> 01:19:26,242
美しい音色を奏でようか
Shall we play a beautiful melody?

794
01:19:26,242 --> 01:19:30,222
あの日の空線のどこかで輝いて
Shining somewhere in the sky's horizon of that day,

795
01:19:30,222 --> 01:19:34,382
はるかな彼方で煌めいて
Sparkling in the distant beyond!

796
01:19:34,382 --> 01:19:38,422
小さな僕の世界を ふたりの奇跡から
From the miracle of the two of us in my small world,

797
01:19:38,422 --> 01:19:42,182
始めようか 手を繋いで
Shall we begin, holding hands?

798
01:19:47,982 --> 01:19:52,982
あなたに届け
Reaching out to you!

799
01:20:31,167 --> 01:20:33,467
戦国前夜の海は今日も
Today too, the sea on the eve of war...

800
01:20:33,467 --> 01:20:36,767
晴れ時々雪 所により大雨
sunny, occasionally snow, heavy rain in places.

801
01:20:36,767 --> 01:20:39,367
千人未到のテラバイトで
In a terabyte uncharted by a thousand men,

802
01:20:39,367 --> 01:20:42,067
まだどこかの あなたと遭遇 旅の途中
we encounter you somewhere on our journey.

803
01:20:42,067 --> 01:20:45,067
偶然だって必然の街
Even coincidences are inevitable in this town;

804
01:20:45,067 --> 01:20:47,767
不思議と星空は見えない程
strangely, so much that the starry sky is invisible.

805
01:20:47,767 --> 01:20:50,367
弾戦 こっちがしっかり来れ
Bullet battle, make sure you come right over here—

806
01:20:50,367 --> 01:20:53,567
変態ステージで 世界中ジャック
jack the whole world on this perverted stage!

807
01:20:53,567 --> 01:20:57,067
ここはゼロと一の楽園
This is a paradise of zero and one,

808
01:20:57,067 --> 01:21:00,867
欲深き世界から 見つけ出して
find me from this greedy world.

809
01:21:00,867 --> 01:21:04,467
遥か遠くからの サバイバル サバイバル
Survival, survival from far away—

810
01:21:04,467 --> 01:21:07,667
こちらに来て来て 水曜日の偉い人
come on over here, you important person of Wednesday!

811
01:21:07,667 --> 01:21:10,767
サーヴィス サーヴィスって 手を叩いて叩いて
"Service, service!" clapping and clapping our hands,

812
01:21:10,767 --> 01:21:13,767
発注 発注 発注で おどりを踊り明かしましょう
placing orders, orders, orders, let's dance the night away!

813
